{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act41side_level_act41side_st01",
  "groupId": "act41side",
  "stageId": "act41side_st01",
  "title": "涉过寒夜",
  "storyCode": "EA-ST-1",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act41side/level_act41side_st01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "13cd0a677b55abcfe3b6abbbd8e5f1efa2df6e4a8be0259f1caf590748d62606",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......这就是红龙的故事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "接下来呢？那些被死火侵染的人怎么样了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没有什么接下来，书上就是这么写的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这不合理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一切都有个尽头，不管这个尽头看起来是否合理，小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这也不是您选择在作品出版后销声匿迹，在这样一间破败的酒馆里藏身的理由。太荒谬了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "荒谬的事还多着呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您就这么喜欢吊人胃口吗？冷眼旁观那些急着知道结局的读者，从中获取心灵上的满足？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "之前倒确实有几位尽责得过了头的信使找到了这里，把读者的信给我送了过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您果然以此为乐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "以此为乐？我看都不去看，直接把信扔进那边的火炉里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真过分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不仅如此，您发表的故事集里就没有一个故事是没被截断的，太过分了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很简单，我不知道该写什么。我写不出结局。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "请回吧，小姐。你显然是个受过良好教育的人，这间粗俗的酒馆不适合你，这几个半截子的故事也不至于让你如此费心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为什么这么急着下逐客令呢？或许我可以帮您一把。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "作家重新打量起眼前的人。即便有兜帽作为遮挡，自己也能看到她面色苍白，想必十分虚弱。\n这个人一来这座荒村就直奔这家酒馆，来之前显然做了不少调查，看来一时半会儿打发不掉。\n作家这么想着，从散落着纸牌和筹码的桌子上抓起黏糊糊的杯子，往嘴里灌了一大口发馊的啤酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那好，你打算给这个故事一个什么样的结局？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为什么是我来给呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "作者毕竟是您，我只想给您提供一些或许能点燃灵感的素材。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "素材？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "去年秋天，你也从那座城市死里逃生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "毕竟只要是经历过的人都看得出，您的故事正是以那段时日为蓝本。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就请吧。我等着听你的素材。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那么，在早已被天灾摧毁的塔拉王城旧址最深处......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在早已被天灾摧毁的塔拉王城旧址最深处，金属炉中的火焰在某个短暂而安宁的日子被人熄灭。\n这本不是什么要紧事，但红龙仍然来到了这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在抗拒被点燃？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还是说，即便是数百年后另一位不祥的异类，也不能重燃被时光腐蚀殆尽的渴求与怨恨？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "或者，我只是太过拘谨了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "紫色的火焰腾地烧到炉外。\n而在火焰的映照下，红龙的脸色分明比方才苍白了几分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "睡醒了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "或者，需不需要我提醒你的身份......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抛下王冠在荒野上行走二十年，却仍在归来时被至亲杀害的可怜红龙，拉布雷德，“放逐王”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真可怜，一位六百年后仍为自己的横死而震惊的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "六百年？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是估算。你死亡的确切年份已经不为人知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的确很震惊，不过不是因为横死，而是原来六百年过去，德拉克之中又出了一条喷吐死火的异种。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们甚至还让你长大成人，没把你扼杀于襁褓之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "维多利亚人让你来把我从死亡中唤醒？或者，你自己的卧室床底下就藏着维多利亚人那傻里傻气的宝冠？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "维多利亚已不是红龙执掌的国度，如今的塔拉也不再听从任何外来者的号令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈，不坏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那看来现在是流行向死者报喜了？真可惜，我没什么能赏你的，你该走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你身上现在燃烧着我的火，只讲几句不着边际的话是不可能了事的，拉布雷德。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "了事？我的事情早就了了。有事未了的，难道不是你吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我懂，我都懂。毕竟是死火嘛，招来的麻烦都差不多。生与死混杂不清，老去的兽群死而不僵，新生的幼兽却早早夭折。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说吧，捅了多大的娄子？一个牧场？一座城市？一片原野？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我用火点燃了整个塔拉，让它从维多利亚的铁蹄下获得了自由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "让这火就这么烧下去，让塔拉化作死者的国度，反正死火自会寻找新的柴薪，我本来是这么想的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可倘若只是因为无计可施，就让如此之多的生命从此消逝，未免失之草率。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因此，我来问问你，若是要将死火从塔拉的原野上一扫而空，又该做些什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......但愿你这些话只是虚张声势。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "任凭你想象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "听好了，我接下来的指点不是为了你，而是为了仍愿意以塔拉为名的人们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "已经被你的火沾染而走向死亡的，生命只会背弃他们，不会回归。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你背后的行尸当然要算在内，那些虽还活着，却已如同行尸走肉的人，他们也已经无药可救。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "去把他们聚集到一起，别再让火焰沾染任何人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "姑息，这就是你能给出的建议？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵......怎么会呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "接下来，去找到另一条红龙吧，假如你的亲族还没被你屠戮殆尽的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "找到一条能用火焰温暖生命的真正的红龙，让尘归尘，土归土，生命归于生命，死亡归于死亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这就是你知道的一切？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊，无知的幼龙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那么，看来你所知的也并不比我更多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "红龙甚至没有费心留下一声冷笑，只是转身离开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她经过一栋破败的房屋，其中隐隐透出橘黄色的烛光。\n这是死者徘徊的旷野，本不该有人烟。也正因此，她敲响了小屋的门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衰朽的老人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是谁并不重要，重要的是，你为什么住在这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衰朽的老人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "以前我住在这里，只因为这里不会有维多利亚人敲响我的门，夺走我从土里刨出的粮食和积蓄......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衰朽的老人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "五年以前，也是这样一个晚上，一位邪恶的术师经过这里，杀死了步步紧逼的维多利亚人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衰朽的老人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我向术师献上兽肉、谷粒和新酿的浊酒，可他告诉我，他不需要这些，他需要的是火，甘愿把自己燃尽，成为薪柴的火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衰朽的老人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "于是，我的独子，基斯，跟着他离开了家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多么高尚的灵魂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衰朽的老人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而三年之后，还是晚上，又有人敲响这扇门。是基斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衰朽的老人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是我已经不会说话，不会哭泣，甚至不会呼吸，只有身上冒出紫火的基斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真不幸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衰朽的老人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而这不幸还没抵达终点。我埋葬了基斯，可他不愿在土中腐烂，反而拖着已死的身躯，在荒原上无尽地游荡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衰朽的老人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这就是我现在还住在这里的原因。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衰朽的老人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是那位术师的同道吗？你是来给基斯以安宁的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，他自己来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一具燃着任谁都能看见的紫火的行尸，晃晃悠悠地朝着二人走来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "红龙用枪尖抵住那具身躯的胸口，整具身躯熊熊燃烧起来，一眨眼的工夫就燃烧殆尽，化为灰烬。\n可老人觉得一阵恍惚，仿佛那火不是燃尽了，而是顺着枪尖流回了红龙身上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那么你呢？你也沾染上了那紫色的死火，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老人看向自己周身，并未看到像独子身上那样的烈焰。可在红龙眼中，他身上的火焰烧得甚至比死者还要旺些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衰朽的老人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......如果你说的是悲伤、愤怒与仇恨，那么是的，女巫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衰朽的老人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "维多利亚人征税以金币，而你们征税以血，你们共同从我身上夺走了一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衰朽的老人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我早已是一具空壳，支撑我站立在此的，唯有你所谓的火焰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那么，我要将你的火焰收回来了，你意下如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衰朽的老人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这一天早该来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老人闭上双眼，迎向红龙的枪尖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他真的感到，一直支撑着自己的那团悲伤与愤怒的火，正向着红龙的手汩汩流出，而与之一同离开身体的，还有他浑浊的意识。\n他预感到死亡将至，但既然他的生活早已停滞，死亡也早就不再可怖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "可火焰突然停止了流动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衰朽的老人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为什么？为什么不杀死我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因为你已经不必被杀死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一个幽魂告诉我，生命已不会再眷顾沾染了死火的人，现在看来，他是对的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“现在看来，他是对的。”红龙冷淡地答道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这一段这样作结如何？我从那位老人口中听到了这样的事，加上一点创作，我想，就算放在您的故事里，也不显得突兀了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在故事里加上那位传说中的放逐王的鬼魂......是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也许能行吧，不过你真的还需要我故事的结局吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您眼里看到的东西显然与我有别。我需要从您的眼睛看，从您的耳朵听。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "难道你是那种喜欢“拼凑真相”的无聊家伙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我从不觉得真相无聊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈，看在我们俩至少都活着从那个地方出来的分上，我可以把那些观察、灵感和写作过程中废掉的文本一股脑抛给你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但那几个故事的结局究竟如何，我无法保证。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然你刚刚讲的是红龙......那我也从红龙开始，怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "作家又往肚子里灌了半杯啤酒，略带挑衅地看了眼前的女性一眼，随后开始讲述。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "如果你曾去过那条红龙名为纳斯尔纱的巢穴，哪怕只是几天，你都不会忘了那片黑林。\n它阴暗潮湿，黑雾弥漫，里面住满了捉弄人的精怪，就像一座漆黑的迷宫。\n据说，除非黑林允许，否则进入其中的人，没有一个能够出来。\n而当黑林允许你通过，愿意为你打开的时候，尽管那些捉弄人的精怪仍会把你带上歧途，嘲笑你的笨拙，但他们最终放你离开时......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "它会美得像一幅画，一幅不该存在于这个世上的画。\n而红龙，带着一路跟她走来的人们，却毫无犹豫地踏入巢穴的范围，把那美丽的景致抛在脑后。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "纳斯尔纱，塔拉之心，“红龙的巢穴”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "纳斯尔纱，塔拉之心，“红龙的巢穴”......我们终于到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "天啊，从石高原野一路到这儿，真的像做了一场好长好长的梦......我真的能把家安在这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这里也不仅有田园牧歌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "塔拉的首府确实没有直接介入伦蒂尼姆的战火，可纳斯尔纱附近，低烈度的渗透和贵族叛乱就从来没停过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "尤其是在红龙带领军队向伦蒂尼姆进军之后......说这里打了一场局部战争也不为过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉啊，苇草，我单纯就是心里高兴，没别的意思！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，回家......是该高兴一些的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "莫兰，你听过什么歌唱这座城市、这片黑林的歌谣吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只有一首，并不是很应景......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唱吧，莫兰！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "清晨我走入黑林，呼唤迷雾♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "踏上通往战场的路途♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没有笛声，没有战鼓♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唯有身后钟声，穿过雾中的水珠♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "回来的路上，我一直想给这首曲子再填上一段词，但没什么灵感。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "苇草，你看起来似乎更担心了。是这首歌太悲伤的缘故吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，和这首歌没关系。这是一首很好的歌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "拉芙希妮没有再说下去。\n在她们身后，流民们一个接一个地走出黑林。\n和跃动着斑斓色彩的胜景相比，眼前的纳斯尔纱不免显得呆板而黯淡。然而，除了拉芙希妮，没人在意这些。\n他们只知道，他们终究走完了这漫长的旅途，他们终于跋涉到了旅途的终点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他们回到了家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "接下来我们怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "会有人来接应我们的。等见到他们——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "拉芙希妮看见人影从城市的方向缓缓走来。\n那只能是迎接他们的人，可上次见面时，他还要杀死她。\n她下意识地展开双手，去护住身侧的莫兰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你为什么在这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我来迎接您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我会护送您进入纳斯尔纱，与爱布拉娜殿下会面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在这之后，如非必要，您不会再见到我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "的确，不见面就能解决的问题，我和她都已经在“加斯特里尔”号上解决了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就请跟我来。至于其余的人......出于安全考虑，我会另外安排。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不行。他们都是塔拉同胞，他们得和我一同进城。我答应过他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我很希望能满足您的愿望，但实话说，城内的绝大多数同胞可不知道还有您这么一条红龙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我保证他们会保守秘密。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这就是您和殿下的不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是说，姐姐会“确保”他们保守秘密？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这就是为什么我要带他们进纳斯尔纱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃......我有一个或许足以两全的办法，您愿意听听吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“守灵人”，你能来到这里，不仅因为你负责纳斯尔纱城内居民的安置，也因为你懂得该如何保持沉默。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "希望你所谓两全的办法不是出于一厢情愿的同情，否则连你也不会再为纳斯尔纱所接受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“守灵人”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“守灵人”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如您所说，纳斯尔纱的确无法立刻对这些同胞敞开大门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“守灵人”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我明天预定要去守灵人的聚落请他们送些祭器，既然现在这些同胞无处可去，我可以先带领他们前往守灵人的居所停留。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "守灵人的居所？“守灵人”不是你从传说和故事中摘取的一个代号吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“守灵人”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的同族的确已经被当作故事传唱许久了，能坚持生活在那些遗迹周围的人不会广泛出没于其他地界，我只是离群的异类。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "正因如此，关于......\n呃，我们眼前这条红龙的一切，都不会被任何外人所知晓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“守灵人”，我很想相信你，但——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您真的曾是守灵人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "莫兰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的曾祖母去世前曾要求过一场由守灵人举办的传统葬礼，家里人在荒野上到处奔波，却一无所获，只能把这当成临终者的胡言乱语。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但曾祖母是个从来都能分得清现实与传说的人，她笃定存在的东西，从来没有错过，何况我也的确听过不少守灵人的故事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我愿意相信你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“守灵人”，请不要辜负他们的信任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“守灵人”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“守灵人”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“校官”先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "涅梅丝？这些人是谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“守灵人”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉在离群后仍来打扰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“守灵人”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们是一些无家可归的塔拉人。纳斯尔纱暂时无力接纳他们，我想，也许......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "许多年前守灵人不禁止你离群已属破例，现在更没理由接纳你带回来的不知底细的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "女士，也许我们并不需要守灵人的接纳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“守灵人”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "莫兰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "从前，在我还想做一名吟游诗人的时候，我就在收集守灵人的传说，寻找你们的部落，传唱你们的故事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "结果吟游诗人和守灵人的梦都被摔得粉碎，只剩回家这一个念头的时候，我居然真的遇上了你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果传说属实，守灵人过着近乎苦修般的生活，与普通人的唯一接点，就是举办葬礼，让死者的灵魂在火中得到安息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们只是跟着......不，从塔拉各处归乡的流民，本就不够格被守灵人所接纳。我们只求能在此处暂住一段时日。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "向您保证，我们会最大程度地遵守守灵人的习俗，不会为你们添什么麻烦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "另外，冬天快要到了，不知道你们是否庆祝丰收的节日。如果能帮上什么忙，您可以尽管吩咐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......夏末节，这是所谓丰收节日的正式称呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看来你们倒确实和城里人有所不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然这样，遗迹外有些无人的小屋，你们可以先打扫一下，在那里住下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "涅梅丝，你还有事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“守灵人”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "城内的深池要举办一场庆祝塔拉光复的庆功会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“守灵人”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我答应他们来向守灵人请些祭器，既是为了显示塔拉的团结，也为了体现塔拉人自己的国度对传统的重视......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "夏末节将至，我们不可能有多余的祭器。你忘记了吗？就算有多余的，我们也不会送出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“守灵人”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "正是因为重视传统，所以深池才希望能请到祭器......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那为什么从所谓独立到现在，没有一个纳斯尔纱人来找我们，让我们帮城内的逝者举行一场符合传统的葬礼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "忘记后再想起，和只是听说名字，就拿来装点自己的门面，我们是分得清的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你觉得无法交差，就把这枚哨笛拿回去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“守灵人”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这只是再普通不过的哨笛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这是我们能给出的最大程度的尊重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "守灵人不和生者团结，也不需要生者的尊重，除非他们已经死去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这才是深池理当尊重的传统。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
